      "description": "Melkah — For marriage, not casual dating.\n\nMelkah is a marriage app for men and women who are serious about finding a life partner, guided by Islamic values.\n\nBROWSE AND DISCOVER\n• Browse without a subscription: Explore profiles and discover potential matches.\n• Advanced search: Filter results by the qualities that matter to you.\n• Connection requests: Manage your sent and received requests and choose who you connect with.\n• Favorites: Save profiles that interest you and revisit them anytime.\n\nMEANINGFUL CONNECTIONS\n• A respectful community: Meet people who share Islamic values and a commitment to marriage.\n• Focused conversations: Connect with up to five people at a time to give each connection the attention it deserves.\n\nCOMMUNICATE WITH PURPOSE\n• Mutual consent: Conversations begin only when both people agree to connect.\n• Individual connection requests: Purchase requests separately without a monthly subscription.\n• Profile questions: Share more about yourself through text or voice answers. You can also suggest new questions for the community.\n• Availability status: Let others know whether you’re available to connect, at the phone-call stage, in a serious relationship, or unavailable.\n\nPRIVACY AND SAFETY\n• Smart filter: Restrict who can view your profile using specific keywords.\n• Visibility controls: Browse in incognito mode, hide notifications of your profile visits, and choose which nationalities can see your profile.\n• Confidential reporting: Submit a report by taking and uploading a screenshot.\n• Private conversations: The Melkah team does not access your chats.\n• View-once photos: Send photos that can be opened only once, with screenshots blocked.\n\nGUIDANCE AND SUPPORT\n• Experienced advisors: Get guidance from advisors with relevant academic and professional backgrounds throughout your search for a life partner.\n• Responsive support: Get help with questions or technical issues.\n\nA PERSONAL EXPERIENCE\n• Detailed profiles: Explore personality types, love languages, and interests to better understand potential matches.\n• Light and dark modes: Choose the display that feels most comfortable for you.\n\nFAMILY INVOLVEMENT\n• Family accounts: Families can create accounts and connect on behalf of their sons or daughters.\n\nJoin Melkah today and take the first step toward finding your life partner.\n\nWebsite:\nhttps://melkah.com",
